Package: neuropublish
Title: Build, Validate, and Publish Neuropublish Result Bundles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", , "bbuchsbaum@research.baycrest.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds Neuropublish result bundles from 'neuroim2' volumes as plain
    R lists that serialize exactly to the public manifest schema (core 0.1),
    writes them as staging bundles under the documented byte profile, computes
    the 'volume-grid' structural fingerprint of a domain, and wraps the reference
    'npub' command-line tool for packing, validation, login, and publication.
    Provides the 'as_neuropublish()' generic that domain packages implement to
    describe their results, and 'np_publish()' which turns such a description
    into one immutable published revision.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    methods,
    neuroim2,
    tools
Suggests:
    knitr,
    processx,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: npub (the Neuropublish publisher CLI) for packing,
    validation, and publication
URL: https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/neuropublish
